{"condition": "B1", "run_id": "B1-dev-revised-rubric", "checkpoint": "nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-BF16", "question_id": "financebench_id_00684", "document_id": "AMCOR_2023_10K", "split": "dev", "training_seed": null, "sampling_seed": null, "derived": false, "evaluation_signature": "98485d04e7dc272169fa2d62058475ceb00a57bb28167a728f778ef2f0aa61cf", "F": 1.0, "A": 0.0, "G": 0.0, "Ret": 0.0, "correct": 0, "grounded_success": 0, "reward": 0.0, "unresolved": true, "grader_version": "workshop-rubric-v2-derived-provenance", "fabricated_citation": false, "judge_error": "RuntimeError", "stop_reason": "accepted_finish", "output_tokens": 1240, "total_reward": 0.0, "turns": 4, "submission": {"answer_type": "text", "value": "", "unit": "", "scale": "", "decision": "", "answer_text": "No, Amcor's gross margin profile did not improve in FY2023. According to the 10\u2011K filing, gross profit as a percentage of net sales was 19.4% in FY2022 and fell to 18.5% in FY2023 (a decline of 0.9\u202fpercentage points). The consolidated gross profit also decreased by $95\u202fmillion (3\u202f%) year\u2011over\u2011year, although excluding currency and divestiture impacts the underlying operating cost performance was slightly favorable. \n\nGross margin remains a useful metric for Amcor because it directly reflects the company's ability to control production costs and price its packaging products. The observed decline was driven primarily by inflationary cost pressures, negative foreign\u2011currency effects, and the impact of disposed/ceased operations, rather than a structural improvement in profitability.", "citations": [{"receipt_id": "r3", "document_id": "AMCOR_2023_10K", "page": 33}, {"receipt_id": "r1", "document_id": "AMCOR_2023_10K", "page": 29}], "calc_id": ""}, "latency_s": 9.00367690400003, "tool_calls": 4, "calculator_used": false, "gold_page_read": false, "citation_count": 2, "visible_citations": 2, "raw_tool_chars": [2450, 90, 6072, 1072], "visible_tool_chars": [2501, 139, 3650, 1123], "truncated_observations": 1, "cost_usd": null, "trace_path": "results/paper_2026_rl4llm/B1-dev-revised-rubric/rollouts/financebench_id_00684.json"}
